# Dev Preview Sandbox

- Single-node k3s, namespace `impilo-preview`, Helm chart `deploy/helm/impilo-vnext`.
- Deploy: `scripts/deploy/preview-build-images.sh` then `preview-deploy.sh`.
- Smoke test after deploy: `scripts/deploy/preview-smoke-test.sh`.
- Not production or formal staging. Test data only. No real secrets in repo.
- Report preview URL, branch, commit SHA, and test results after deployment.
